      ],
      "solution": "Reading increasing t from left to right, the curve rises from the ride's start t=0 until t=6, is horizontal from6 to14, and falls from14 to the endpoint16. With transition points6 and14 reported separately in the lesson's style, increasing is [0,6[, constant is ]6,14[, and decreasing is ]14,16]. The plateau's speed is5 m/s; its endpoint values also equal5. The start and final displayed speeds are0. No exact speed between these times is needed or justified.",
